"""
Demo: Scrollable Notebook Resizing Tabs
Created: October 6, 2026

Description: Solves tab overflow problem in the "Demo: Closable Notebook Tabs" 
project by pairing a tabless ttk.Notebook with a canvas-backed scrollable tab 
bar. Features mousewheel scrolling, left/right scroll buttons, active-tab 
auto-scrolling, and sidebar bidirectional sync.

This version integrates a low-profile, modern horizontal scrollbar directly 
between the custom scrollable tab strip and the main workspace canvas, 
providing smooth click-and-drag scrolling alongside mousewheel support.

Based on "Demo: Scrollable Notebook Tabs" project.
"""

